# fannkuch-redux over base's IOArray, in IO. A closed call runs at run
# time, so a function value stays, a sum once defunctionalized, and
# building it allocates. After counting, the loops change no count (the
# arrays are borrowed, their elements are atoms).
idr-rc: counts-nothing=@Main.rev counts-nothing=@Main.flips counts-nothing=@Main.next counts-nothing=@Main.copy counts-nothing=@Main.loop
